<title>USA: Antec Corp Q1 loss after merger costs.</title>
<headline>Antec Corp Q1 loss after merger costs.</headline>
<dateline>ROLLING MEADOWS, Ill. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		 $  0.42   profit     $  0.19</p>
<p> Net loss		  16,124   profit	 7,470</p>
<p> Sales		    120,034		  183,149</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,420		   39,593</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Antec completed a merger with TSX Corp on February 6, 1997. 1997 Q1 loss includes merger and integration costs of $28 million on a pre-tax basis. This total includes a $6.5 million write-off of redundant inventories relating to overlapping product lines and product development efforts.</p>
<p>		 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
